# The AppImage tools (WS-13), pinned by release and SHA-256 (the digests of the downloaded files when they were
# pinned; build-appimage.sh refuses any other bytes), one set per machine architecture (uname -m). linuxdeploy and
# its Qt plugin assemble the AppDir; appimagetool packs it with the pinned type-2 runtime (passed as a file, so
# nothing is fetched at pack time).
#
# Format: KEY=value, one per line, no spaces around `=`.

